      <details><summary>When can I expect to notice a difference?</summary><p>Everyone&#39;s different, so we won&#39;t promise results. Give it a full jar as part of your daily routine. If it isn&#39;t for you, the first-jar guarantee has you covered.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is there sugar in it?</summary><p>Yes, it&#39;s a gummy, so it contains glucose syrup and sugar. The full list is under &ldquo;Key ingredients&rdquo;.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I have to subscribe?</summary><p>No. Every order is a one-off purchase. Nothing renews automatically.</p></details>
      <details><summary>When do you launch, and do I pay now?</summary><p>We&#39;ll email you the moment we launch. Reserving is free: nothing to pay today. Founding 500 members hear first and get 20% off a single jar on their first order.</p></details>
    </div>
